<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- LedgerPrime product logo (docs/CORRECTIONS_LOG.md, "make a logo for this project and implant
     it") - a self-contained, opaque version of the same double-entry-ledger mark already used for
     the launcher icon (ic_launcher_foreground.xml/ic_launcher_background.xml), so the app has one
     consistent brand mark rather than a second, competing design invented just for documents. Used
     wherever the PRODUCT (not the user's own business) needs to be identified: the invoice PDF
     header, and the in-app drawer/About. Opaque dark-navy rounded-square background (unlike the
     launcher's separate adaptive-icon layers) so it reads correctly on white paper when printed. -->
